From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lethalbas <lethalbas@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 19:55:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] build(win): define YY_SKIP_YYWRAP in Engine scanners

flex 2.6.4 declares 'extern "C" int yywrap(void)' when compiled as
C++, but Scanner.l/smcScan.l define yywrap()/syywrap() with C++
linkage (C2732). Suppress the generated prototype; the user
definition precedes its only use in yylex().

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Sources/Engine/Base/Scanner.l | 2 ++
 Sources/Engine/Ska/smcScan.l  | 2 ++
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Sources/Engine/Base/Scanner.l b/Sources/Engine/Base/Scanner.l
index fd51475b4398bb610bc1355bd5c410bf11a382d2..93b5dc2ef318703c4110d892242740843df11758 100644
--- a/Sources/Engine/Base/Scanner.l
+++ b/Sources/Engine/Base/Scanner.l
@@ -1,6 +1,8 @@
 %top{
 /* SSTRE: flex >= 2.6 built-in skeleton; replaces the precompiled-header include formerly emitted by the legacy skeleton */
 #include "StdH.h"
+/* user code defines yywrap() with C++ linkage; suppress flex 2.6 extern "C" prototype */
+#define YY_SKIP_YYWRAP
 }
 %{
 #include "ParsingSymbols.h"
diff --git a/Sources/Engine/Ska/smcScan.l b/Sources/Engine/Ska/smcScan.l
index b178610fdbe3c67279b22d9c0c14df499f243f9c..c94fab54e3035c1168c522a5d4b8785e7e19f665 100644
--- a/Sources/Engine/Ska/smcScan.l
+++ b/Sources/Engine/Ska/smcScan.l
@@ -1,6 +1,8 @@
 %top{
 /* SSTRE: flex >= 2.6 built-in skeleton; replaces the precompiled-header include formerly emitted by the legacy skeleton */
 #include <Engine/StdH.h>
+/* user code defines yywrap() with C++ linkage; suppress flex 2.6 extern "C" prototype */
+#define YY_SKIP_YYWRAP
 }
 %option prefix="syy"
 %{
